# corpus/mac/emoji_expand_smile_01 — emoji shortcut :smile + Space → 😀 (P2-5 §2)
:config method=telex diacritic_style=new
:app com.apple.notes field=textarea

:config method=telex diacritic_style=new macro_trigger=space emoji=":smile=😀"
:type ":smile"
:expect ":smile"
:expect_action REPLACE
:key Space
:expect "😀"
